    "In Fastmail, open Settings, then Privacy & Security, then Manage API tokens. Make a new token with Email access, Email submission so you can send, and Masked Email and Contacts if you use them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "In Mail App, open Admin, then API & webhooks, and make a new key with Read, Organise, Send and Delete for your mailboxes. Use your email address, the key as the password and your Mail App address as the server.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "In Stalwart's web interface, open your account's security settings and make an app password for JMAP Connect. The server is the address you open Stalwart's web interface on.": {
